security forces shot it dead.

782
00:45:33,565 --> 00:45:36,151
Only to trigger its swan song.

783
00:45:37,193 --> 00:45:38,194
Acid for blood?

784
00:45:38,361 --> 00:45:40,071
Sulfuric and hydrofluoric.

785
00:45:40,238 --> 00:45:41,907
