816
00:47:23,425 --> 00:47:25,510
yet rational - sometimes
hardest - path.

817
00:47:25,802 --> 00:47:27,554
You must help them.

818
00:47:27,721 --> 00:47:28,722
You must help them.

819
00:47:28,888 --> 00:47:30,056
[indistinct chatter]

