I'm right here.

831
00:47:50,618 --> 00:47:52,120
Let's go, let's go. Come on.

832
00:47:54,330 --> 00:47:55,331
Tyler, let's go, man! Come on!

833
00:47:55,498 --> 00:47:56,499
