888
00:50:39,495 --> 00:50:41,289
Navarro, please.
Navarro! Navarro!

889
00:50:41,456 --> 00:50:42,665
Hey, hey, hey.

890
00:50:42,874 --> 00:50:43,875
[Navarro choking]

891
