- [Navarro] Kay!

898
00:51:10,193 --> 00:51:12,862
[Kay] What's happening?
What's happening?

899
00:51:15,281 --> 00:51:17,200
[weakly]
Please don't let me die.

900
00:51:20,119 --> 00:51:21,120
[Kay] Someone help!

901
00:51:21,287 --> 00:51:22,830
[Navarro grunting]

902
00:51:23,748 --> 00:51:25,250
[screaming]

903
00:51:33,007 --> 00:51:34,092
[screaming]

