959
00:55:29,827 --> 00:55:30,828
Follow me.

960
00:55:32,497 --> 00:55:34,040
[Tyler] What? Our situation?
How do you...

961
00:55:34,207 --> 00:55:36,167
Andy! Andy!

962
00:55:40,296 --> 00:55:41,839
[electricity crackling]

963
00:55:44,383 --> 00:55:45,843
